            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a cleaning surface for contact cleaning apparatus. The cleaning surface includes a substrate, detachably mountable to the contact cleaning apparatus, supporting a first polymer layer with a surface. A first topographical feature or layer is applied to and / or formed in at least a portion of said first polymer layer, and said first polymer layer is radiation cured. The present invention also relates to a method of forming a contact cleaning surface.</p>
